6. Conveying Non-Source Forms.

You may convey a covered work in object code form under the terms
of sections 4 and 5, provided that you also convey the
Corresponding Source under the terms of this License, in one of
these ways:

  a) Convey the object code in, or embodied in, a physical product
  (including a physical distribution medium), accompanied by a
  machine-readable copy of the Corresponding Source fixed on a
durable physical medium customarily used for software interchange.

  b) Convey the object code by providing access to copy
download from a designated place (which may be a network server),
and offer equivalent access to the Corresponding Source in the same
way through the same place at no further charge.  If the place to
  copy the object code is a network server, the Corresponding Source
  provided must be the same as the source code for the object code
offered to the public in this way, and must remain available for as
  long as the object code remains available to users.

  c) Convey individual copies of the object code with a copy of the
  written offer to provide the Corresponding Source.  This written
offer must be valid for at least three years and must be
  transferable.  You may charge a fee for the physical distribution
  of the Corresponding Source, and you may charge a reasonable fee to
  cover the cost of distribution of the object code.

  d) Convey the object code by offering access from a designated
  place (gratis or for a charge), and offer equivalent access to the
  Corresponding Source in the same way through the same place at no
  further charge.

The source code conveyed in accordance with this section must be
the Corresponding Source for the object code conveyed, and must
be licensed under the terms of this License.  You must include a
copy of this License with every copy of the Corresponding Source you
convey.  If you convey the object code using access from a designated
place, entitlement to copy the source code from the designated place
is preserved for as long as the object code is so available there.

